c33-3211-4a6a-90f5-4258ad29a5d0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Openings and endings", "children": [{"id": "0dfb5865-071e-400c-96de-7571e0149223", "type": "concept", "title": "Anecdotal leads"}, {"id": "801d41d6-11fb-4857-8358-57ff221813ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Delayed leads"}, {"id": "0b560501-8257-4e3a-afc1-4952e3feaa56", "type": "concept", "title": "Kickers"}, {"id": "928e6b7c-1a3f-4a37-bfbb-a7b46d42318f", "type": "concept", "title": "Circular endings"}], "description": "Beginnings earn attention; endings deliver meaning without over-explaining."}]}, {"id": "320afacb-5736-4f3b-8eb4-c77c7ee60d47", "type": "topic", "title": "Scene-Setting, Description, and Immersive Detail", "description": "Uses observation, sensory detail, place, action, and selective description to create vivid nonfiction scenes.", "children": [{"id": "dcb7fd6e-c773-4481-b622-211f6170fd65", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scene construction", "children": [{"id": "3eebbf5b-21f8-4441-bacc-1dc79df76f7f", "type": "concept", "title": "Time and place"}, {"id": "7f3c77b6-be76-4775-9034-fda0b4358fb7", "type": "concept", "title": "Action"}, {"id": "726aaf13-42b9-4a73-839c-8da60f5ffcd3", "type": "concept", "title": "Dialogue"}, {"id": "95ddc3ee-54ca-4164-ae68-cfb3e7904b96", "type": "concept", "title": "Character movement"}], "description": "Scenes make reported nonfiction feel immediate while staying factual."}, {"id": "2d6f3301-ce98-42e9-a32c-246a7ac7350c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Description discipline", "children": [{"id": "a1ddd375-a4ed-43c3-b9f2-39b1e97129f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Sensory reporting"}, {"id": "c4fce180-61e7-4e0c-9abb-5d50dc63da86", "type": "concept", "title": "Specific nouns"}, {"id": "167c5df9-a870-456e-9efe-75b452d61d37", "type": "concept", "title": "Telling detail"}, {"id": "3db94523-8892-46b7-b777-23adae3bc5d9", "type": "concept", "title": "Avoiding cliche"}], "description": "Vivid writing depends on selected detail, not decorative overload."}, {"id": "cb1fe8b8